(7456395, 1181639, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. I usually suggest black &amp; white, only to have later regrets- (here the flowers and the red siding come to mind) but also, because so much of the shot is gray, the contrast of n=monochrome might be an improvement.</td>', 'I like the composition. I usually suggest black & white, only to have later regrets- (here the flowers and the red siding come to mind) but also, because so much of the shot is gray, the contrast of n=monochrome might be an improvement.', '2016-05-24 13:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7456396, 1181652, 12611, '<td valign="top">why the toothbrush I say to myself? naked in the shower- what do you clean with a toothbrush? certainly not teeth. perhaps the grout? anyway- I am thinking outloud again. Nice shot overall.</td>', 'why the toothbrush I say to myself? naked in the shower- what do you clean with a toothbrush? certainly not teeth. perhaps the grout? anyway- I am thinking outloud again. Nice shot overall.', '2016-05-24 13:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
