(7486666, 1181373, 1031, '<td valign="top">Fine high-contrast image. I wish there was a little more contrast in the veined leaves ... I wonder if this could be helped with a color filter/gel or a custom WB setting (with later conversion to grayscale).</td>', 'Fine high-contrast image. I wish there was a little more contrast in the veined leaves ... I wonder if this could be helped with a color filter/gel or a custom WB setting (with later conversion to grayscale).', '2016-12-09 13:45:47.000000', NULL, 0),
